 8 │     for n in [1] do val twice = n * 2
   │                     ────────┬────────
   │                             ╰────────── more than `do` takes
   │
   │ Help: write the body in braces
   │
   │ Note: `do` takes a call, an assignment, a `yield`, a jump, or an `if … then` without an `else`; more is written in braces
───╯
